# merge：被合并分支新增的文件与未追踪文件同名，挡路报错且状态不变
> init
<<<
+ base.txt mbase.txt
> add base.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# given 侧新增 inway.txt 并提交
> checkout other
<<<
+ inway.txt mgiven.txt
> add inway.txt
<<<
> commit "other adds inway"
<<<

# 回到 master，工作目录手工放一个未追踪的同名文件
> checkout master
<<<
+ inway.txt mcur.txt

> merge other
There is an untracked file in the way; delete it, or add and commit it first.
<<<

# 未追踪文件仍是手工放置的版本，未被覆盖
= inway.txt mcur.txt
